    notice: ["Are you often eating while working, driving, standing or doing something else?", "Do you eat much faster when you are stressed or short on time?", "Does your appetite disappear when you are under pressure and then return strongly later?", "Do you notice any difference in how your stomach feels when you eat quickly compared with when you have time to sit?", "Which meals feel easiest to manage when you are mentally tired?", "Are there meals you can keep available that remove the need to make another decision?"],
